 (text "Jetson dev kit: J12 40-pin ribbon (2x20 box header) and J14 button-header harness" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "054c583f-9c59-50df-953c-e32df3f938b1"))
(text "J12 per C_jetson_mech.md section 5: pins 1, 2, 4, 24, 37, 39, 40 not connected (a ribbon turned round maps" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7ff96a43-f0a2-53af-b9ae-b953bc1f869d"))
(text "pin n to 41-n: nothing then shorts the dev-kit 5 V). Board outputs toward the Jetson are behind 1k: the dev" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b163c135-0db2-5250-a44e-52e7ace72a56"))
(text "kit level-shifts these pins (TXB-type, holds a pin through about 4k), so 10k would not toggle them (review M1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b0d393f6-8401-59dc-8794-6f69ced3c290"))
(text "UART1 (pins 8 TX, 10 RX) passes to the FSESC COMM header, crossed (10k toward the FSESC, 1k toward the Jetson);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "60845533-ab7f-5526-ae9e-20d5ee710505"))
(text "the VESC 3.3 V pin is not used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "0e911573-0697-55e4-bde2-5b804695a0a6"))
(text "I2C1 (pins 3/5, bus 7, 2.2k pull-ups on the dev kit) to the Pico GP4/GP5 through 330 Ohm (DNP), no pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "ce54ab59-55fb-5aa2-aa23-8b7355160e91"))
(text "J14: PC817s across 12/11 (power key, 150-200 ms) and 8/7 (reset, 100 ms); recovery button 10/9;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "28da028a-3704-5aa5-a672-6e550461e3e1"))
(text "console 3/4/7. Pins 1, 2, 5, 6 open (auto power-on stays enabled). Key the 1x12 housing with a printed clip." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "43e03119-72ac-58c5-a3ee-e5bded5efe06"))
